cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the thainowcast pipeline, also cite the software."
title: "thainowcast: pseudo-real-time nowcasting of Thai GDP and inflation with official and alternative data"
abstract: >-
  Open pseudo-real-time nowcasting pipeline for Thai quarterly GDP growth and
  monthly headline CPI inflation: a release-calendar information set, a
  mixed-frequency model race (bridge, MIDAS, dynamic factor model, elastic net,
  LightGBM), regime-split evaluation with Diebold-Mariano tests, conformal
  intervals, alternative-data ablations and a Kalman-filter news decomposition.
type: software
authors:
